Inherited from upstream: the editorial design system, the 41 visual types and
their reference documents, the semantic patterns, the accessible motion
contract, the draw.io, Mermaid and Excalidraw import extractors, the export
procedure and SVG exporter, the self-check and per-type verifiers, the
templates, and the taste gate.

Added by this fork: the multi-brand token registry and its refusal path,
mechanically enforced accessibility (rules A1-A8 and scripts/lint-a11y.py), the
cognitive-load rules (C1-C9), the WCAG contrast library, and CI. FORK-NOTES.md
records what changed and why, decision by decision.

